      "text": "### Anatomy and How a Toilet Works"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-FIXTURES.md#010",
      "path": [
        "06-FIXTURES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:plumbing:06-fixtures, git-history:plumbing:06-fixtures]",
        "canonical_path": "plumbing/06-FIXTURES.md",
        "concepts": "[fixtures]",
        "current_path": "plumbing/06-FIXTURES.md",
        "id": "maxim:plumbing:fixtures",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "plumbing",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[fixtures]",
        "section": "plumbing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fixtures",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  TANK COMPONENTS:\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │                    TANK                                      │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  FILL VALVE ──────────────────────────────────────────────   │\n  │  (float-cup type)    Float rises as tank fills → valve       │\n  │                      closes. Float drops when flushed →      │\n  │                      valve opens → tank refills.             │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  OVERFLOW TUBE ───────────────────────────────────────────   │\n  │  (vertical tube)     Water level must stay BELOW top.        │\n  │                      If fill valve fails open: water runs    │\n  │                      into overflow tube → into bowl → drain  │\n  │                      (prevents tank overflow to floor)       │\n  │                                                              │\n  │  FLAPPER ─────────────────────────────────────────────────   │\n  │  (rubber seal at    Lifts via chain when handle pulled.      │\n  │   flush valve)       Water rushes from tank to bowl.         │\n  │                      Drops when tank empties → seals.        │\n  │                      Failure mode: hardens, warps, or        │\n  │                      deposits prevent sealing → running      │\n  │                      water (30,000+ gallons/year wasted)     │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
