        "title": "Fixtures",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "THE FLUSH SIPHON:\n    Bowl has integral siphon trap (S-curve visible from side)\n    When tank water enters rapidly → creates siphon in trap →\n    bowl contents siphon out completely\n    Siphon breaks when bowl empties (air enters) → \"gurgle\" end\n    Trapway size: larger = fewer clogs\n    MaP (Maximum Performance) rating: tests mass flush performance\n      (grams of solid waste in single flush)\n      300g = acceptable; 500g+ = excellent; 1000g = exceptional\n```"
    }
